  <data name="ConnectionDetailsEncryptionBody" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>FTPS Server dey encrypt both commands and data.
E only support EXPLICIT TLS (AUTH TLS / FTP over TLS).

For di client, choose:

  Protocol: FTP
  Encryption: Explicit TLS
    (FileZilla: "Require explicit FTP over TLS"
     WinSCP: "TLS/SSL Explicit encryption"
     Cyberduck: "FTP-SSL (Explicit AUTH TLS)")

No choose Implicit FTPS (dem often just write "FTPS") — e no go connect.</value>
